              },
              "content": "<ruby:识别到帅气姐姐音>太好了，你终于醒了！</ruby>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204004101_2993373615_content",
                "value": "<ruby:识别到帅气姐姐音>太好了，你终于醒了！</ruby>",
