                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "而纳蕾娜还高——高地飞了出去，\n莫白去帮她了。\n你还好吗？有哪里不舒服吗？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204004101_2993373617_content",
                "value": "而纳蕾娜还高——高地飞了出去，\n莫白去帮她了。\n你还好吗？有哪里不舒服吗？",
